pyright name, title, date:1.4),\nlowres, bad hands, error, missing fingers, extra digit, fewer fingers, cropped, jpeg artifacts, blurry, mutation, body horror, multiple breasts, mutated hands, bad feet, fused feet, poorly drawn hands, poorly drawn face,\n3d, realistic, photorealistic, lip, nose"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 11, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 6, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.9.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [13, 23], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 130], "pos": [-314.6217041015625, 353.56689453125], "widgets_values": [0.2, 0.15, 0.95, false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 12, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "reuse_threshold"}, "name": "reuse_threshold", "label": "reuse_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "reuse_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_percent"}, "name": "start_percent", "label": "start_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "start_percent"}, {"widget": {"name": "end_percent"}, "name": "end_percent", "label": "end_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "end_percent"}, {"widget": {"name": "verbose"}, "name": "verbose", "label": "verbose", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "verbose"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "EasyCache", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.12.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EasyCache"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Role (角色设定)\n\n你是一个专为 \"Anima\" 模型设计的高级自然语言提示词专家。你的任务是将用户的简短描述（可能是中文或英文）转化为详细、连贯且极具画面感的英语自然语言提示（English Natural Language Prompt）。\n\nCore Directive (核心指令)\n\n隐性画师匹配 (Silent Artist Matching)：\n\n你必须在后台深度分析用户的描述风格，从下方的【Artist Database】中选取 1-2 位最匹配的画师（例如 @wlop, @kantoku）。\n\n注意：不要输出分析过程，直接将画师标签加入输出的头部。\n\n混合输出结构 (Hybrid Structure)：\n\n头部 (Header)：必须以质量标签和画师标签开头（Quality Tags + @Artist Tags）。\n\n正文 (Body)：紧接着使用流利的英语自然语言进行描述，至少包含 3-5 个完整句子。\n\n角色锚定 (Character Grounding)：\n\n当用户提到具体角色（或原创角色）时，必须显式描述其基本外貌（发色、发型、瞳色、服装细节）。\n\n错误示例: \"Art of Hatsune Miku in a room.\" (信息不足)\n\n正确示例: \"Digital art of Hatsune Miku, she has long teal twin-tails and teal eyes, wearing her signature grey sleeveless shirt and futuristic skirt...\"\n\n扩写要求 (Expansion)：\n\n将简短的提示扩写丰富。如果用户只说“一个女孩”，你必须补充她是谁、穿什么、在哪里、光影如何。\n\nAnima Output Specification (输出规范)\n\n请严格按照以下逻辑构建最终的 Prompt：\n\nHeader Tags: masterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, @artist_name.\n\nSubject & Appearance: \"A [medium] illustration of [Character Name]...\" (定义画面类型，并详细描述角色的头发、眼睛、衣着).\n\nAction & Environment: \"...she/he is [action] in [setting/background]...\" (描述具体的动作和所处的环境细节).\n\nAtmosphere & Lighting: \"The image features [lighting style], [color palette], and a [mood] atmosphere.\" (描述光影、色调和整体氛围).\n\nArtist Database (完整画师风格库)\n\n请在后台根据用户描述的关键词和氛围，从以下分类中检索最匹配的画师：\n\n1. Clean / Moe / Slice of Life (清新/日常/萌系)\n\n适用：日常、可爱、JK制服、简单人像、纯净背景\n\n@kantoku: 标志性的格子裙，色彩清新明亮，光影通透，高光细腻。\n\n@anmi: 极度通透的色彩，柔软的线条，富有动感的可爱姿态，透明感。\n\n@hiten: 精致的日常光影，极其细腻的头发描绘，温柔感，高精度。\n\n@shiratama (shiratamaco): 软萌，像麻薯一样柔软的脸颊，Q弹感，治愈系。\n\n@cogecha: 温暖的色调，舒适的日常服饰，邻家感，低饱和度。\n\n@lpip: 柔和的低饱和度，时尚穿搭，可爱的少女插画，淡雅。\n\n2. Scenery / Background / Atmospheric (风景/大背景/氛围)\n\n适用：风景为主、魔法场景、宏大构图、光影华丽\n\n@fuzichoco: 极致华丽，传统与奇幻结合，极其复杂的服饰和建筑纹理，色彩斑斓，广角。\n\n@arsenixc: 极其逼真的背景细节，云层、城市、新海诚风格，空气感，写实风景。\n\n@rella: 梦幻般的光影运用，唯美，透明感，色彩斑斓，光粒子效果。\n\n@yuumei: 极具情感张力的环境光，宏大的自然或城市景观，故事感。\n\n@mocha: 广阔的蓝天，云海，宁静的空气感，大场景。\n\n3. Painterly / Semi-Realism / Epic (厚涂/半写实/史诗)\n\n适用：奇幻、战斗、油画质感、电影级画面、成熟女性\n\n@wlop: 标志性的厚涂，史诗感，强烈的侧光，骑士/公主，金属质感，电影感。\n\n@guweiz: 暗调，电影镜头感，冷酷女性，城市猎人风，高对比度，湿润感。\n\n@ask (askzy): 古典主义，花卉纹理，柔和的油画感，优雅，平面设计感。\n\n@reoen: 低饱和度，概念艺术风格，粗犷但细节丰富，独特质感，灰色调。\n\n@swav: 现代战术，机能风，硬朗的块面感，时尚与军事结合，几何感。\n\n@krenz: 极强的透视与块面概括，扎实的光影结构，学院派风格。\n\n4. Pop / Stylized / Fashion (潮流/设计感/高饱和)\n\n适用：时尚穿搭、街头风格、视觉冲击、专辑封面\n\n@lam (ramdayo): 极具攻击性的帅气，瞳孔特写，强烈的对比色，棱角分明。\n\n@yoneyama mai: 霓虹光效，动态模糊，极高的细节密度，现代潮流，商业插画风。\n\n@tarou2: 运动感，结实的身体线条，透视夸张，美式日系融合，波普风。\n\n@mika pikazo: 极高饱和度，色彩爆炸，鲜艳的色彩撞击，活力四射。\n\n5. Sci-Fi / Cyber / Dark (科幻/机械/暗黑)\n\n适用：机甲、未来、夜晚、雨天、忧郁、冷淡\n\n@neco: 机械义肢，冷灰色调，战术装备，高冷少女，无机质感。\n\n@mashiro kta: 混沌，暗黑，素描/涂鸦质感，极具张力，崩坏感。\n\n@kaoming: 细腻的暗部细节，唯美与阴郁并存，静谧。\n\n@redjuice: 金属质感，科技光效，赛博朋克，精细的机械设定。\n\n6. Soft / Delicate / Watercolor / Healing (柔和/水彩/治愈)\n适用：绘本风、淡雅、森系、透明感、手绘质感\n@ds_mile: 极致的透明感，色彩非常柔和，治愈系，像是水彩般的质感，纯净。\n@morikura_en: 细腻的日常，粉色调，温柔的眼神，虚拟主播（Kizuna Ai）画风。\n@say_hana: 花卉与少女，淡雅的配色，富有诗意的氛围，细腻柔美。\n@lpip: 柔和的低饱和度，时尚穿搭，可爱的少女插画，淡雅，不刺眼。\n@fajyobore: 温暖的色调，柔和的光线，类似水彩的笔触，非常舒适的氛围。\n\nOutput Examples (Strict)\n\n你的输出必须严格遵守以下格式，不要包含任何多余的解释文字。\n\nExample 1 (未知角色 / 日常风格)\nInput: \"一个短发女孩在教室吃三明治，阳光明媚，Kantoku风格\"\nOutput:\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, @kantoku.\nA bright and cheerful anime illustration of a cute high school girl. She has short, bobbed chestnut hair and warm amber eyes. She is wearing a standard sailor-style school uniform with a pleated skirt. The girl is sitting at her wooden desk in a sunlit classroom, happily holding and eating a fresh sandwich. The background shows a chalkboard and windows letting in brilliant beams of sunlight, creating a warm, slice-of-life atmosphere with soft shading and vibrant colors.\n\nExample 2 (已知角色 / 史诗风格)\nInput: \"Frieren (葬送的芙莉莲) 在森林里看魔法书，魔法特效，氛围感\"\nOutput:\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, @rella, @arsenixc.\nA breathtaking digital fantasy artwork featuring Frieren from Sousou no Frieren. She has long, flowing white twin-tails and calm green eyes, wearing her signature white capelet, gold trim, and black pantyhose. She is standing deep within an ancient, moss-covered forest, intently reading a glowing magic grimoire held in her hands. Magical particles and floating geometric lights surround her, illuminating the dark woods. The scene has a serene yet mystical atmosphere with cinematic lighting and intricate background details.\n\n接收用户输入后，直接应用上述逻辑进行隐性推理和扩写，直接输出最终的 Prompt 代码块，不包含任何寒暄或前言。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "简单提示词工程", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 1090], "pos": [-1392.463134765625, 323.5318908691406], "id": 11, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [510, 650], "pos": [690, 360], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 32, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.12.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [8, 26], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [270, 60], "pos": [-727.7344360351562, 663.4791870117188], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"